2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e1ba442ddc4edbe6c462b99afd3c0b93 2x, https://si.imgix.net/965f4a40/uploads/origins/e1d8d59d-8246-4331-8cea-b43e360311fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=259cdf2ce266396466dadd8151a63ea9 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I've been a fan of your work for a while and I've never used SKEB before so I hope I'm doing everything right, but thought to take my chance after seeing you open !! My userame is Yuwuki1 but you may call me Nai!\n\nI wanted to know if you'd be okay drawing my alien character here! ( You may use the colored reference )\nThey wear a mask with piercings on the outside, never show their face and are pretty tall. They dress pretty wild and love cool patterns...\n\n I marked the commission as NSFW due to  their nudity, but you don't have to draw anything directly sexual with them! I give you free reign on stylizing their design and composition! I'm not very picky and trust your design sense! I love the surreal environments you depict and the world they live in is very similar, with a very dreamlike and musical feeling...I'd love for something with them in  scene playing a daegeum/flute while herding some cows/sheep like a pied piper, or with a gombangdae/korean smoking pipe. They farm and tend to smoke on the job...\nTheir mask does have a small hole by its mouth so it's fine to draw the pipe over it if chosen\n\nIf you accept, thank you and I'd definitely come back in the future if accepted!! Have a good day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mIsEQUTnNKg8gGSu_n-PCkeyWfF3F8IE?usp=sharing", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@pebble1250/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3850783, "client_id": 3862311, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d4668823/uploads/origins/90